---
// src/pages/terms.astro
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service – Jyotish Consultations"
  description="Terms and conditions for using Jyotish Consultations services. Please read carefully before booking a consultation."
  ogImage="/terms-og.jpg"
>
  <article class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 800px;">
      
      <header style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 48px;">
        <p class="section-eyebrow mb-2">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="section-title mb-3">Terms of Service</h1>
        <hr class="gold-divider" />
        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-top: 16px;">Last Updated: January 2025</p>
      </header>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-midnight-ink);">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-bottom: 16px;">
          By accessing or using the Jyotish Consultations website and services, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service ("Terms"). If you do not agree to these Terms, please do not use our services.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-midnight-ink);">2. Description of Services</h2>
        <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-bottom: 16px;">
          Jyotish Consultations provides astrology, numerology, and Vastu Shastra consultation services based on Vedic traditions. Our services include:
        </p>
        <ul style="line-height: 1.8; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 20px;">
          <li>Live one-on-one consultation sessions (video/phone)</li>
          <li>Quick consultation services with email responses</li>
          <li>Birth chart analysis and reports</li>
          <li>Numerology readings and guidance</li>
          <li>Vastu Shastra consultations for homes and offices</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-charcoal-light);">
          All services are provided for educational, entertainment, and spiritual guidance purposes only.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-midnight-ink);">3. Important Disclaimer</h2>
        <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-bottom: 16px; background: #FEF3C7; padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #F59E0B;">
          <strong>Our consultations are for guidance and informational purposes only.</strong> They should not be considered as professional advice in legal, medical, financial, psychological, or any other specialized field. Always seek qualified professional advice for important life decisions.
        </p>
        <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-top: 16px;">
          We do not guarantee specific outcomes or results from our consultations. The information provided is based on Vedic astrological principles and should be used at your own discretion.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-midnight-ink);">4. Booking and Appointments</h2>
        <h3 style="font-size: 16px; margin: 20px 0 12px; color: var(--color-voltage-violet);">Scheduling</h3>
        <ul style="line-height: 1.8; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 20px;">
          <li>Appointments must be booked in advance through our website</li>
          <li>You will receive a confirmation email with session details</li>
          <li>Please join the session 5 minutes before the scheduled time</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 style="font-size: 16px; margin: 20px 0 12px; color: var(--color-voltage-violet);">Rescheduling and Cancellations</h3>
        <ul style="line-height: 1.8; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 20px;">
          <li>Free rescheduling is allowed up to 24 hours before the appointment</li>
          <li>Cancellations within 24 hours may incur a 50% cancellation fee</li>
          <li>No-shows will be charged the full session fee</li>
          <li>To reschedule or cancel, please contact us at support@jyotish.example.com</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-midnight-ink);">5. Payment Terms</h2>
        <ul style="line-height: 1.8; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 20px;">
          <li>Payment is required at the time of booking</li>
          <li>We accept payments through Razorpay (credit/debit cards, UPI, net banking)</li>
          <li>All fees are in Indian Rupees (INR) unless otherwise specified</li>
          <li>Fees are subject to change without prior notice</li>
          <li>Discounted or promotional rates may have specific terms and conditions</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-midnight-ink);">6. Client Responsibilities</h2>
        <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-bottom: 16px;">As a client, you agree to:</p>
        <ul style="line-height: 1.8; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 20px;">
          <li>Provide accurate birth details (date, time, place) for astrology consultations</li>
          <li>Ensure a quiet, private environment for the session</li>
          <li>Have a stable internet connection for video consultations</li>
          <li>Be respectful and courteous during the consultation</li>
          <li>Use the information provided responsibly and ethically</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-midnight-ink);">7. Confidentiality</h2>
        <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-bottom: 16px;">
          We maintain strict confidentiality regarding all client information and consultation content. Your personal details and session discussions will not be shared with third parties without your consent, except as required by law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-midnight-ink);">8. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-bottom: 16px;">
          All content on this website, including text, graphics, logos, and reports, is the property of Jyotish Consultations and protected by copyright laws. You may not reproduce, distribute, or create derivative works without our written permission.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-midnight-ink);">9. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-bottom: 16px;">
          To the maximum extent permitted by law, Jyotish Consultations shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from the use of our services. Our total liability shall not exceed the amount paid for the consultation service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-midnight-ink);">10. Modifications to Services</h2>
        <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-charcoal-light);">
          We reserve the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue any aspect of our services at any time without prior notice. We are not liable for any changes that may affect your use of our services.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-midnight-ink);">11. Governing Law</h2>
        <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-charcoal-light);">
          These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of India. Any disputes arising from these Terms shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of courts in India.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-midnight-ink);">12. Contact Information</h2>
        <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-charcoal-light);">
          For questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us:<br />
          <strong>Email:</strong> support@jyotish.example.com<br />
          <strong>Address:</strong> Jyotish Consultations, India
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
